  "title": "Telehealth Visit Authorization Form",
  "subtitle": "Capture patient location, technology check, identity verification, and privacy setting; confirm clinician connection and backup route.",
  "description": "Telehealth Visit records patient location, technology check, identity verification, privacy setting, clinician connection, and backup route. Telehealth Visit evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this telehealth visit authorization decision when staff must document patient location and technology check. Reconcile identity verification, privacy setting, clinician connection, and backup route before the telehealth visit handoff. Use the appointment record, identity verification, physical-location confirmation, technology test, privacy check, clinician connection log, emergency backup, and after-visit handoff. This encounter centers remote connection readiness, video or audio platform, patient physical location, private setting, callback reliability, clinician link, local emergency route, and reconnection fallback. Ask the assigned telehealth visit reviewer to confirm patient location against the organization's policy.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
